  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ctxrs/ctx/zipball/v2.0.5",
  "body": "This patch repairs the path from older ctx installations to ctx 2.x.\n\n- Current releases and new installs use a separate stable update feed.\n- Older 1.x installations can first download the small 1.6.5 bridge, then upgrade to the current release.\n- Existing 2.x installations that miss the transition can update by rerunning the installer. Their indexed history is retained.\n\nInstall or update:\n\n```sh\ncurl -fsSL https://ctx.rs/install | sh\n```\n\nOn Windows:\n\n```powershell\nirm https://ctx.rs/install.ps1 | iex\n```\n"
}
